msgctxt "748"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "769"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "779"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "785"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "806"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "838"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "873"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "901"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "921"
msgid "Very well, sir. That comes to %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "955"
msgid ""
"The strongest supplement on the market. Will fully\n"
"restore your health."
msgstr ""
"L'integratore più potente sul mercato. Ripristinerà completamente la tua "
"salute."

msgctxt "1027"
msgid ""
"Will fill your Heat to its maximum level. You'll be a\n"
"walking inferno!"
msgstr "Rempirà la tua barra Furore al massimo. Sarai un inferno che cammina!"

msgctxt "1098"
msgid ""
"Will rejuvenate your body and soul. And it'll restore \n"
"your health and Heat to their maximum levels!"
msgstr ""
"Rinvigorirà il tuo corpo e la tua anima. E ripristinerà la tua salute e la "
"barra Furore ai loro livelli massimi!"

msgctxt "1199"
msgid ""
"These plastic shin guards provide light protection. \n"
"They're thin, so don't expect too much. "
msgstr ""
"Questi parastinchi di plastica offrono una leggera protezione. Sono sottili,"
" quindi non aspettarti troppo."

msgctxt "1293"
msgid ""
"This black belt is special, as they say the power of its \n"
"late judo master resides within. It should give you \n"
"extra throwing strength."
msgstr ""
"Questa cintura nera è speciale: si dice che contenga il potere del suo "
"defunto maestro di judo. Dovrebbe darti una forza extra nelle proiezioni."

msgctxt "1429"
msgid ""
"This towel brings a sense of peace to its user, \n"
"lowering their Heat."
msgstr ""
"Questo asciugamano dona un senso di pace a chi lo usa, abbassando la sua "
"barra Furore."

msgctxt "1499"
msgid ""
"These are steel shin guards. They'll help protect your\n"
"legs from attacks."
msgstr ""
"Questi sono parastinchi d'acciaio. Ti aiuteranno a proteggere le gambe dagli"
" attacchi."

msgctxt "1573"
msgid ""
"They say if you grab someone from behind while \n"
"wearing these gloves, you'll steal some of their cash.\n"
"Don't ask me how it works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1703"
msgid ""
"This ring increases your physical strength more and\n"
"more as you get injured."
msgstr ""
"Questo anello aumenta la tua forza fisica sempre di più man mano che vieni "
"ferito."

msgctxt "1780"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Rage items at once, and a berserker\n"
"rage will overwhelm you, providing you with\n"
"inhuman strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1894"
msgid ""
"A mysterious power residing in this thing somehow\n"
"strengthens left-handed attacks."
msgstr ""
"Un potere misterioso che risiede in questo oggetto in qualche modo rafforza "
"gli attacchi mancini."

msgctxt "1977"
msgid ""
"Put on this ring, and you'll have people coming at you\n"
"in droves for a chance to defeat the Champ."
msgstr ""
"Indossa questo anello e la gente ti verrà addosso a frotte per avere la "
"possibilità di sconfiggere il Campione."

msgctxt "2076"
msgid ""
"Will have a healing effect if you stand calmly during \n"
"a fight."
msgstr ""
"Avrà un effetto curativo se rimani fermo e calmo durante un combattimento."

msgctxt "2140"
msgid ""
"This is a photo of an old and influential yakuza. They \n"
"say just carrying it will awaken the bloodlust of the \n"
"people around you. "
msgstr ""
"Questa è la foto di un vecchio e influente yakuza. Si  dice che il solo "
"portarla con sé risvegli la sete di sangue delle persone intorno a te."

msgctxt "2271"
msgid ""
"Grab onto someone with these on, and they'll have a\n"
"hard time escaping your iron grip."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2358"
msgid ""
"Grab an enemy while wearing these to sap their \n"
"strength and charge your Heat up."
msgstr ""
"Afferra un nemico mentre li indossi per prosciugargli le forze e caricare il"
" tuo Furore."

msgctxt "2440"
msgid ""
"I've heard that wearing the three Sacred Tree items\n"
"at once will make you bulletproof."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2527"
msgid ""
"This is a pendant of a lion dog, also called a Shisa. \n"
"Equip all 3 Shisa items to increase your defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2632"
msgid ""
"There's something I really don't like about this bloody\n"
"binding. Be careful when you use it..."
msgstr ""
"C'è qualcosa che non mi piace in questa benda insanguinata. Fai attenzione "
"quando la usi..."

msgctxt "2727"
msgid ""
"This chain mail is said to confer upon its wearer the \n"
"protection of a divine dragon... or something. It's \n"
"really well-made, anyway."
msgstr ""
"Si dice che questa cotta di maglia conferisca a chi la indossa la protezione"
" di un drago divino... o qualcosa del genere. In ogni caso, è fatta molto "
"bene."

msgctxt "2861"
msgid ""
"This flak vest is super resistant to bullets. It's extra \n"
"durable due to its special creation process."
msgstr ""
"Questo giubbotto antiproiettile è super resistente ai proiettili. È "
"estremamente robusto grazie al suo speciale processo di creazione."

msgctxt "2964"
msgid ""
"Equip all three Rage items at once, and a berserker \n"
"rage will overwhelm you, providing you with \n"
"inhuman strength."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3080"
msgid ""
"This is a belly warmer decorated with a lion dog, also \n"
"called a Shisa. Equip all 3 Shisa items to increase your\n"
"defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3202"
msgid ""
"Did you know this sword is actually mentioned in\n"
"ancient literature? It's referred to as a phantom\n"
"sword."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3308"
msgid ""
"Wristbands are good for absorbing sweat, but they're\n"
"not very effective at defending you from attacks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3411"
msgid ""
"If you're wondering why we have a block of solid \n"
"brass, a customer special ordered it. He left the \n"
"business, though, so it's dead stock now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3554"
msgid "They used this steel in ancient times to forge katanas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3610"
msgid ""
"It might just look like an ordinary gold ball, but it's\n"
"actually a gem of immeasurable value."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3704"
msgid ""
"Only someone highly proficient in many weapons can\n"
"own this gem as proof of their skill. Many of them \n"
"were left throughout the world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3839"
msgid ""
"This brooch has the Yin dragon carved into it. It's \n"
"quite unique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3906"
msgid ""
"This brooch has the Yang dragon carved into it. Seems\n"
"quite mystical."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid ""
"People say there used to be an underground \n"
"coliseum that held brutal tournaments, and this\n"
"comb was awarded to the best of its combatants."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4116"
msgid ""
"A red dragon is carved into this brooch. It may hold \n"
"some ancient power."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4190"
msgid ""
"This brooch has a rising dragon engraved on it. Seems\n"
"to be a rather valuable antique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4277"
msgid ""
"The dragon on this brooch is the same type that's \n"
"tattooed on your back. It practically oozes power.\n"
"It'd be perfect for you, sir."
msgstr ""
